WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.680
If you take medication for seizures, please take it as scheduled on the morning

2
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:04.480
of your procedure

3
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.640
with a small sip of water, unless your doctor's office has told you otherwise.

4
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:09.760
It is very important

5
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:14.010
not to skip seizure medication without explicit guidance from your care team.

6
00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.040
If you have any

7
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.960
uncertainty about your dosing instructions, please call your doctor's office

8
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.000
before your appointment

9
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.560
time. Your safety is the priority, and they want to make sure your medication

10
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.600
routine is handled

11
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.160
correctly before you arrive.
